  "findings": [
    "Layer 15 is the only layer that selected the UUID value page under the baseline but lost it under prefill hybrid. All twelve deep layers still select it in both arms. Layer 3 gains both key and value pages under prefill hybrid.",
    "At layer 15 the UUID page had already left the resident window and has no accepted prefill score. Question Mean-K can recall it from canonical cold history; resident-only prefill selection cannot.",
    "Switching only layer 15 from Mean-K to prefill ranking reproduces 100 to 0; restoring only layer 15 Mean-K in the full hybrid recovers 0 to 100. Other layer policies remain fixed, but downstream Q and page selections naturally change.",
    "In the failing full hybrid, swapping one of 576 layer-15 pages for the UUID page recovers 100. It is a sufficient rescue in that context.",
    "The reverse one-page deletion from the passing baseline still scores 100. Therefore missing this page at layer 15 is not a sufficient explanation of failure by itself; the broader layer-15 selected context and propagated hidden state matter."
  ],
